 Digital Portfolio Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/digital-portfolio-management/dpm-using-cfx.md","line":64},{"title":"Enterprise portfolios","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/digital-portfolio-management/dpm-enterprise-portfolios.md","line":69},{"title":"Navigate portfolio types in Digital Portfolio Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/digital-portfolio-management/dpm-navigating-enterprise-portfolios.md","line":71},{"title":"Create enterprise portfolios in Digital Portfolio Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/digital-portfolio-management/dpm-create-enterprise-portfolios.md","line":73},{"title":"Enterprise portfolios","target":"dpm-enterprise-portfolios","line":77},{"title":"Digital Portfolio Management","target":"dpm-landing","line":78},{"title":"Service Portfolio Management","target":"SPM2-landing-page","line":79},{"title":"Applications","target":"dex-workspace-application-tab","line":80}],"metadata":{"title":"Navigate enterprise portfolios in Digital Portfolio Management","description":"You can work with three types of enterprise portfolios in the Digital Portfolio Management \\(DPM\\) Workspace — service, business application, and service instance. Even though you can view service enterprise portfolios in DPM, they're created with Service Portfolio Management tables. Enterprise portfolios for business applications and service instances are created with the enterprise portfolio tables.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-service-management/digital-portfolio-management/dpm-enterprise-portfolio.html","release":"australia","product":"Digital Portfolio Management","classification":"digital-portfol